The '''Isle of Souls''' is an island located in the [[Shrouded Ocean]], west of [[Feldip Hills]]. It is where the [[Soul Wars]] [[minigame]] takes place.

The island was once the site of a battle during the [[God Wars]]; the [[Armadyl]]ean soldiers that were sent there were tasked with securing an [[Soul Stone|unknown artefact]],{{CiteNPC|npc=Ancient Ghost|quote=We [Armadyleans] were here to claim something. To protect it. But everything else is unclear.}} however it was claimed by [[Bandos]], who evidently used it to destroy not only the Armadyleans{{CiteNPC|npc=Ancient Ghost|quote=Big High War God use the shiny to kill the chickens! Now we clear up the rest!}} but his own army as well.{{CiteNPC|npc=Player|quote=Sorry to be the bearer of bad news, but I think this 'shiny' might have killed you as well.}} This resulted in some of those slain becoming [[Ancient Ghost|ancient ghost]]s, unable to move on to the next world.

The island was since abandoned, until [[Nomad]] opened it up and started hosting Soul Wars.{{CiteNPC|npc=Garl|quote=Until that Nomad chap opened things up, this island was abandoned.}}

==Transportation==
The isle can be accessed through a few different means:

* Entering the [[Soul Wars Portal]] near the [[Edgeville ruins]].
* Entering the Soul Wars Portal inside the [[Ferox Enclave Dungeon]].
* Using the Soul Wars [[Minigame Teleport]].
* Using the [[fairy ring]] code {{Fairycode|BJP}} to reach the northern coast.
* By mooring on the south-east coast with 55 [[Sailing]].
* Using the rowboat from the [[Tear of the Soul]] on the south-east coast.

==Dungeon==
{{Main|Isle of Souls Dungeon}}
On the east side of the island is the [[cave (Isle of Souls Dungeon)|entrance]] to the [[Isle of Souls Dungeon]], which houses several types of monsters such as [[Lesser demon|lesser]] and [[Greater demon|greater demons]], [[Fire giant|fire giants]], and [[Blue dragon|blue]], [[Baby blue dragon|baby blue]] and [[Iron dragon|iron dragons]]. Two [[adamantite rocks|adamantite]] and one [[Runite rocks|runite rock]] may also be found near the dragons, as well as six [[blue dragon scale]] spawns. Finally, the dungeon also contains a [[Chest (Isle of Souls Dungeon)|chest]] that can be [[Thieving|picked open]] for a variety of loot, including notably the rare [[dark key]], used to open [[Dark Chest|another chest]] on the north-west side of the island.

[[Dwarf multicannon|Dwarf multicannons]] can be used in this dungeon.

==Crumbling Tower==
{{main|Crumbling Tower}}
In the basement of the Crumbling Tower, the [[Dark Chest|dark chest]] can be found, which can be opened with a [[dark key]]. In the basement, several [[spider]]s can be found, and several level 20 [[Forgotten Soul|forgotten soul]]s haunt each of the higher floors.

==Resources==
There are several resources spread throughout the island. It should be noted that the only [[bank]] and [[deposit box]] in the area are found in the [[Soul Wars Lobby]], which is very far away from most of the resources.
* To the south-east, there is a maple grove with 15 [[maple tree]]s.
* Several [[yew tree]]s can be found on the isle; 6 are located on the south-west side of the island, and another 4 can be found on the north side.
* Some [[teak tree]]s and [[mahogany tree]]s can be found near the north coast of the island.
* On the south side of the island, [[Isle of Souls mine|a mine]] is located where players can find a variety of rocks, including a spot where three adjacent [[iron rocks]] can be mined.
* On the south-western coast of the island, some [[Fishing spot (small net, bait)|net/bait fishing spots]] can be found.
* On the eastern coast of the island, there are several [[Fishing spot (big net, harpoon)|net/harpoon fishing spots]].
* On the north-eastern side of the island there are some [[Fishing spot (cage, harpoon)|cage/harpoon fishing spots]].
* A small [[flax]] field is located near the teak and mahogany trees on the north side of the island.

