==NPCs and monsters==
The island features many different types of creatures. Attackable monsters include [[rabbit]]s, [[bird]]s, [[cow]]s, [[imp]]s, [[chicken]]s, [[sand crab]]s, [[unicorn]]s, [[moss giant]]s, [[pyrefiend]]s and [[pyrelord]]s, as well as some [[rat]]s.

Apart from a small area in the north where there are a few [[bird]]s, the entire island is [[single-way combat]].

The island features several hunting areas. On the north side of the island, players may attempt to catch [[copper longtail]]s (with 9 [[Hunter]]), with [[Chinchompa (Hunter)|grey chinchompas]] (53 [[Hunter]]) being located to the north-west. On the south-west side of the island, near the broken potter's wheel, some [[crimson swift]]s (1 [[Hunter]]) may be found.

Aside from these, several [[butterfly|butterflies]] and [[squirrel]]s wander around the island.

==Miscellaneous==
===Spinning wheel===
At the north of the island there is a [[Broken Spinning Wheel|broken spinning wheel]]. Players can repair it at level 5 [[Construction]] with a [[hammer]], 5 [[plank]]s, 1 [[ball of wool]], and 1 [[iron bar]] and receive 200 Construction experience. Players can use [[temporary skill boost]]s to build this.

===Potter's wheel===
At the south-west of the island there is a [[Broken Potter's Wheel|broken potter's wheel]]. Players can repair it at level 2 [[Construction]] with a [[hammer]], 2 [[plank]]s, 1 [[soft clay]], and 1 [[iron bar]] and receive 150 Construction experience. Players can use [[temporary skill boost]]s to build this.

